WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.376
"Oh no!" thought Flopsy.

2
00:00:07.377 --> 00:00:10.258
"The farmer is coming!"

3
00:00:10.259 --> 00:00:13.747
Mrs.Tittlemouse jumped into a pot.

4
00:00:13.748 --> 00:00:16.991
Flopsy hid under the paper bag.

5
00:00:16.992 --> 00:00:20.643
The other bunnies were still sleeping.

6
00:00:20.644 --> 00:00:23.515
Flopsy shook with fear.

7
00:00:23.516 --> 00:00:27.652
"This is terrible," she thought.

8
00:00:27.653 --> 00:00:36.390
"The farmer will get the bunnies!"

9
00:00:36.391 --> 00:00:39.349
The farmer had a sack of grass.

10
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:45.461
He dumped the grass onto the trash pile.

11
00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:49.010
"Huh." The farmer looked down.

12
00:00:49.011 --> 00:00:53.389
"I see . . . little brown ears."

13
00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:56.907
The farmer bent closer to the pile.

14
00:00:56.908 --> 00:01:01.206
"One . . . two . . . three . . .

15
00:01:01.207 --> 00:01:09.563
Three little rabbits!"

16
00:01:09.564 --> 00:01:12.867
The farmer scooped up the bunnies.

17
00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:20.328
He dropped them into his sack.

18
00:01:20.329 --> 00:01:23.538
"Yum," said the farmer.

19
00:01:23.539 --> 00:01:28.311
"I have big plans for these rabbits!"

20
00:01:28.312 --> 00:01:41.032
The farmer tied the sack with string.

21
00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:44.956
"First I must put away my lawn mower.

22
00:01:44.957 --> 00:01:49.902
Then I'll come back."

23
00:01:49.903 --> 00:01:54.351
The farmer left.

24
00:01:54.352 --> 00:01:58.245
"Oh no!" Flopsy cried.

25
00:01:58.246 --> 00:02:02.759
She ran to the sack.

26
00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:07.151
Flopsy tried to rip the string from the sack.

27
00:02:07.152 --> 00:02:10.504
"It's too tight," she cried.

28
00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:13.415
"The farmer will take the bunnies.

29
00:02:13.416 --> 00:02:19.730
And they'll never come home again!"

